{#- 레이아웃 B : 직독직해형 (기존 6개 섹션 도구 '⑥ 직독직해' 디자인). 명세서 §7 -#}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{{ analyses[0].title_en if analyses else '직독직해' }}</title>
<style>
  :root{ --lit:#b45309; --line:#e5e7eb; --ink:#23272e; --muted:#6b7280; }
  @page{ size:A4 portrait; margin:12mm 11mm; }
  *{ box-sizing:border-box; }
  html,body{ margin:0; padding:0; }
  body{
    font-family:'NanumSquareRound','Nanum Gothic','NanumGothic','Malgun Gothic','Apple SD Gothic Neo',system-ui,sans-serif;
    color:var(--ink); font-size:12px; font-weight:400;
  }
  .sheet{ page-break-after:always; }
  .sheet:last-child{ page-break-after:auto; }

  /* 주황 헤더 바 (⑥ 직독직해 made by 은아 T) */
  .lbar{
    background:var(--lit); color:#fff; border-radius:6px;
    padding:8px 12px; display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:9px; flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .lbar .num{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    width:19px; height:19px; border-radius:50%; background:#fff; color:var(--lit);
    font-size:12px; font-weight:800; flex:none; align-self:center;
  }
  .lbar .tit{ font-size:15px; font-weight:800; white-space:nowrap; }
  .lbar .made{ font-size:11px; font-weight:600; opacity:.95; }
  .lbar .sub{ font-size:10px; font-weight:600; opacity:.92; margin-left:auto; }
  .lbar .lec{
    font-size:11px; font-weight:800; background:rgba(255,255,255,.22);
    border-radius:9px; padding:1px 9px; white-space:nowrap; align-self:center;
  }

  /* 2단 직독직해 표 */
  table.lit2{ width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; table-layout:fixed; margin-top:8px; }
  table.lit2 th{
    background:var(--lit); color:#fff; font-size:10px; font-weight:700;
    padding:4px 8px; text-align:left; width:50%; border:1px solid var(--lit);
  }
  table.lit2 td{ border:1px solid var(--line); padding:6px 9px; vertical-align:top; width:50%; }
  .lit-row td{ border-bottom:1.5px solid #f0ddc0; }
  .snum{
    display:inline-block; background:var(--lit); color:#fff;
    font-size:9px; font-weight:800; width:15px; height:15px; line-height:15px;
    text-align:center; border-radius:50%; margin-right:5px; vertical-align:1px;
  }
  .lit-line{ line-height:1.65; }
  .lit-line .sl{ color:#cbd5e1; padding:0 3px; font-weight:700; }
  .lit-line .ck{ font-weight:600; }

  /* 청크 색상 팔레트 — 영어와 한글이 같은 색으로 대응 */
  .ck0{ color:#1d4ed8; } .ck1{ color:#15803d; } .ck2{ color:#b45309; }
  .ck3{ color:#7c3aed; } .ck4{ color:#be123c; } .ck5{ color:#0f766e; }
  .ck6{ color:#a16207; } .ck7{ color:#4338ca; }

  /* 문장별 핵심 문법 태그 */
  .lit-gram{ margin-top:6px; padding-top:4px; border-top:1px dotted #f0ddc0; }
  .gline{ display:block; margin-top:3px; line-height:1.4; color:#1d4ed8; }
  .gtag{
    display:inline-block; font-size:9.5px; font-weight:700;
    color:inherit; border:1px solid currentColor; border-radius:3px;
    padding:0 6px; margin-right:5px; background:transparent;
  }
  .gtag.keytag{ font-weight:800; }
  .gexp{ font-size:9.8px; color:#23272e; }

  /* 핵심 단어 */
  .lit-words{ display:block; margin-top:5px; font-size:10px; color:#23272e; line-height:1.55; }
  .lit-words b{ color:#111827; }

  /* '쉽게' 요약 줄 */
  .lit-note-row td{ background:#fffdf7; font-size:10.5px; color:#7c3a06; border-bottom:1.5px solid #f0ddc0; }
  .lit-note-row .nlbl{
    display:inline-block; background:#d97706; color:#fff;
    font-size:9px; font-weight:800; padding:1px 8px; border-radius:9px; margin-right:6px;
  }

  .footer{ margin-top:9px; text-align:right; font-size:9.5px; color:var(--muted); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
{% for a in analyses %}
  <div class="sheet">
    <div class="lbar">
      <span class="num">⑥</span>
      <span class="tit">직독직해</span>
      {% if brand %}<span class="made">made by {{ brand }}</span>{% endif %}
      {% if a.lecture_label %}<span class="lec">{{ a.lecture_label }}강</span>{% endif %}
      <span class="sub">문장별 핵심 문법 포함 · ★ = 관계사·분사·가정법·비교·도치·강조·5형식 필수 어법</span>
    </div>

    {% set lits = a.literal if a.literal else [] %}
    <table class="lit2">
      <thead><tr><th class="lh-en">영어 원문 + 핵심 문법</th><th class="lh-ko">직독직해 + 핵심 단어</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
      {% if lits %}
        {% for s in lits %}
        <tr class="lit-row">
          <td class="lit-en">
            <span class="snum">{{ s.no }}</span>
            <span class="lit-line">
              {%- for c in s.chunks -%}
                <span class="ck ck{{ loop.index0 % 8 }}">{{ c.english }}</span>{% if not loop.last %}<span class="sl">/</span>{% endif %}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </span>
            {% if s.grammar %}
            <div class="lit-gram">
              {% for g in s.grammar %}
              <div class="gline{% if g.ci is not none %} ck{{ g.ci % 8 }}{% endif %}">
                <span class="gtag{{ ' keytag' if g.key }}">{% if g.key %}★필수 {% endif %}{{ g.point }}</span>
                {% if g.explanation %}<span class="gexp">{{ g.explanation }}</span>{% endif %}
              </div>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
            {% endif %}
          </td>
          <td class="lit-ko">
            <span class="lit-line">
              {%- for c in s.chunks -%}
                <span class="ck ck{{ loop.index0 % 8 }}">{{ c.korean }}</span>{% if not loop.last %}<span class="sl">/</span>{% endif %}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </span>
            {% if s.words %}
            <span class="lit-words">
              {%- for w in s.words -%}<b>{{ w.word }}</b> {{ w.meaning }}{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{%- endfor -%}
            </span>
            {% endif %}
          </td>
        </tr>
        {% if s.note %}
        <tr class="lit-note-row"><td colspan="2"><span class="nlbl">쉽게</span>{{ s.note }}</td></tr>
        {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      {% else %}
        {# 직독직해 데이터가 없으면 원문/해석만이라도 대조 표기 #}
        {% for s in a.sentences %}
        <tr class="lit-row">
          <td class="lit-en"><span class="snum">{{ s.index }}</span><span class="lit-line">{{ s.text }}</span></td>
          <td class="lit-ko"><span class="lit-line">{{ s.translation }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      {% endif %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    {% if footer_note %}<div class="footer">{{ footer_note }}</div>{% endif %}
  </div>
{% endfor %}
</body>
</html>
